<title>USA: Burnham Pacific plans 5.5 mln share offer.</title>
<headline>Burnham Pacific plans 5.5 mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burnham Pacific Properties Inc said Monday it plans a 5.5 million share offering through underwriters led led by Morgan Stanley &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The shares are being offered pursuant to a shelf filing, the company said.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to reduce debt associated with the recent acquisition of two shopping center portfolios comprised of seven centers and three single-asset acquisitions, the company said.</p>
</text>
